AVGen-Bench protocol and canonical metadata

This directory contains an Ayase-owned, standard-library-only implementation of
the dataset aggregation protocol and exact canonical prompt/face-annotation JSON
files from Microsoft AVGen-Bench at revision
1049eabac472d479fe5feeb1ee202961f8e0982a.

Upstream source: https://github.com/microsoft/AVGen-Bench
Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation.
License: MIT; see LICENSE in this directory.

The JSON assets under assets/prompts and assets/face_annotations are copied from
immutable Git blobs. assets/manifest.json records their upstream paths, Git blob
identities, byte lengths, record counts, and SHA-256 digests. The generated
manifest and Ayase integration code are part of Ayase; they are not upstream
AVGen-Bench files.

This foundation does not bundle model weights or third-party evaluator code and
does not alter the separate terms that may apply to those components.
